<title>USA: Duckwall-ALCO Stores Inc Q2 net rises.</title>
<headline>Duckwall-ALCO Stores Inc Q2 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>ABILENE, Kan. 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended   Six Months Ended</p>
<p>				 Jul 28,  Jul 30,    Jul 28,  Jul 30,</p>
<p>				    1996     1995	 1996     1995</p>
<p> Net sales		   $68,426  $62,592   $127,774 $117,532</p>
<p> Cost of sales		46,099   42,381     85,805   79,139</p>
<p>   Gross profit	     22,327   20,211     41,969   38,393</p>
<p>Selling, general and</p>
<p>administrative expenses</p>
<p>				  18,553   17,048     35,465   32,884</p>
