<p>				  19,478   17,808     37,254   34,381</p>
<p>   Income from operations  2,849    2,403	4,715    4,012</p>
<p>	 Interest expense	860	782	1,592    1,417</p>
<p>	 Income tax		765	616	1,196	986</p>
<p>   Net income		  1,224    1,005	1,927    1,609</p>
